        {
          "type": "html",
          "name": "A2_T3",
          "html": "<div style=\"background:#f0f4ff; border-left:4px solid #4f46e5; padding:12px 16px; border-radius:6px; margin-bottom:8px;\"><p style=\"margin:0 0 12px;\">Over the past week, ADA ranked and re-ordered your activity items. Thinking about how the tool <strong>ordered your activity items</strong> — please rate your agreement with each statement below, grouped into three areas:</p><div style=\"display:flex; gap:10px; margin-bottom:12px;\"><div style=\"flex:1; background:#ffffff; border:1px solid #c7d2fe; border-radius:6px; padding:8px 10px; text-align:center; font-weight:600; color:#4338ca;\">Agreement</div><div style=\"flex:1; background:#ffffff; border:1px solid #c7d2fe; border-radius:6px; padding:8px 10px; text-align:center; font-weight:600; color:#4338ca;\">Stability</div><div style=\"flex:1; background:#ffffff; border:1px solid #c7d2fe; border-radius:6px; padding:8px 10px; text-align:center; font-weight:600; color:#4338ca;\">Trust and responsiveness</div></div><p style=\"margin:0; font-size:0.9em; color:#555;\"><strong>Answer choices for all questions in this section:</strong> Strongly agree &middot; Agree &middot; Neither agree nor disagree &middot; Disagree &middot; Strongly disagree</p></div>"
